### 5. FRAMEWORK ATTRIBUTIONS

The Software utilizes psychological communication archetypes inspired by the Process Communication Model (PCM), originating with Dr. Taibi Kahler, and the DISC model, originating with Dr. William Moulton Marston. These theoretical frameworks are acknowledged for contextual reference. The specific algorithmic scoring engine, dual-lens synthesis, situational divergence analysis, incident tactical playbooks, and client-side implementation are the original creative works and property of Jack Likert.

